  {
   "type": "callout",
   "kind": "warn",
   "title": "Verbos sin -ing",
   "text": "Los verbos que expresan un estado casi nunca llevan -ing: <b>know, like, love, want, need, understand, believe, own</b>. Así que <i>I <b>know</b> him</i>, no <i>I'm knowing him</i>; <i>I <b>want</b> a coffee</i>, no <i>I'm wanting</i>."
  },
